# Release excludes promotion trace

## Rule

The `release/` product MUST NOT carry execution logs, QA work artifacts, or records documenting the mechanics of promotion. Required operational or product documentation is allowed. Process evidence, when retained, stays outside `release/`.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
